fixture dash_up_lip_stairs
doc ground dashes right up both staircases of test/lip_stairs: two lips a tick on the 45-degree stair (task 5 review, H3).
room test/lip_stairs
spawn 300 544
frames 120
input
  0 R dash
  1..29 R
  30 R dash
  31..59 R
  60 R dash
  61..89 R
  90 R dash
  91..119 R
end
expect
  # Ground dashes walk up both staircases: up to three 8 u lips in a dash tick on the second.
